      <title>PortWin 1.26</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 17:16:37 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.26</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Microsoft Store packages (.msix, .appx and bundles) are recognised properly: PortWin reads their name and icon, and suggests the Mac version when one exists (for example, Claude).</li><li>Web installers and Setup.exe files without a built-in archive are now recognised as installers by their version information.</li><li>32-bit games that use XAudio get the 32-bit XAudio component (64-bit games keep the 64-bit one).</li><li>DirectX 12 games: the recommendation now explains that D3DMetal graphics are connected separately — once, free, from Apple’s website.</li></ul>]]></description>
